{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "248b19f9-1428-8190-bad8-47d9d3585b80",
  "created_at": "2025-12-21T14:39:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilson Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:35:20-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, Kevin. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, so I'm glad somebody picks up this line. I got the number off the recording. Can you hear me okay? I'm on speakerphone, I've got my hands full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:35:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, you're coming through fine. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:35:39-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I'll start from last week, because it matters. Last Sunday the drain on the corner here was already running slow. Leaves all over it. Then Wednesday the soaker starts, goes into Thursday, and by Thursday night that drain is full to the top. Three days ago. And it hasn't gone down. It is still full. Not draining at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:36:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the storm drain on the corner, full to the brim since Thursday. Where are you exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Number 2 Old Beach Road, right at the corner, up from Easton's Beach. The water's spread out into the street and over the edge of the sidewalk, and it's just sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 2 Old Beach Road. Any chance it's frozen, or is it more like debris blocking it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:36:29-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, maybe. [pause] I don't know. There's a skin of ice on the edges in the morning. But I looked Friday and Saturday and the water level is the same. Nothing's going down that grate. I'm not a drain guy, I'm just telling you it doesn't move."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's helpful. Writing that down. Drain full, no movement, since Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And here's what's bugging me. Kids walk through here to get down to the beach, and people come by with their dogs all day. It's a big puddle, almost a pond, and with the ice on it somebody's going to slip or a dog's going to wander in. [line breaks up] Sorry, you cut out, did you get that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got most of it. Kids and dog walkers going by, ice on the edges. Yeah, that's a fair concern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:37:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Because I called, well, I didn't call, I figured somebody would notice. It's been three days. Nobody's come by, no cone, nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:37:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put it in as a storm drain blockage. Do you want a work order opened on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:37:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's what I'm asking. Is a work order going to get opened, and for what date? I want an actual date, not just somebody will look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll open it now, so it's logged today, Sunday. Crews are working through a backlog from the storm, so I'd say early this week is realistic, but the crew lead sets the day. I'll flag it as standing water by a walking route."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:38:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Early this week. Fine. Can you give me a number for it so I can reference it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:38:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It'll generate once I save it. Let me get your name and a callback number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:38:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nilson Varela. V-A-R-E-L-A. Phone is 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nilson Varela, 401-555-0194. And Varela, is that with a V like Victor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, V like Victor. And while we're at it, can you spell the word you said for the thing blocking it? Debris, or was it, uh, de-bree? It sounded like a name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:38:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. D-E-B-R-I-S. Same word, just said the French way, de-BREE. Leaves and junk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:38:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, D-E-B-R-I-S. I'll put that on my note. I'm writing everything down because, honestly, I've been through this. Not at my house, but the neighbors have had water in the street before and it took forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:39:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. Okay, it's in. I've got it as a blocked storm drain at the corner of 2 Old Beach Road, standing water, ice forming, pedestrians and dog walkers. Priority note added."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:39:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So early this week. Not next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:39:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I'm putting down, Monday or Tuesday if they can get to it. If you see the water rise or it gets worse, call back on this line, even on a weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:39:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. And if I see somebody about to fall in it, I'm going to put a chair out there myself. Just so you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:39:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough, just stay out of the water yourself. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:39:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T14:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Nilson. Take care."
    }
  ],
